# Gmail SMTP Configuration for automated emails:
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on your Google Account (contact@xinkdigitals.com)
# 2. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Generate a 16-character App Password (name it "Next.js Website")
# 4. Copy it below into .env.local:
GMAIL_USER=contact@xinkdigitals.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your_16_character_app_password
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://xinkdigitals.com
